          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Sengoku Blade: Sengoku Ace Episode II, originally released in Japan as Tengai, is a horizontally scrolling shoot 'em up video game released for arcade machines in 1996 by Psikyo as a sequel to the 1993 shooter Sengoku Ace. It was later released as a part of Psikyo Shooting Collection Vol. 2: Sengoku Ace & Sengoku Blade for the PlayStation 2.\n\nThe game is set in a historical fantasy version of the Sengoku period of Japanese history, featuring demons, magic and steam-powered robotics. It was followed by Sengoku Cannon: Sengoku Ace Episode III, released for the PlayStation Portable in 2005.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Sengoku Blade: Sengoku Ace Episode II, lanzado originalmente en Japón como Tengai, es un shoot 'em up de desplazamiento horizontal publicado para máquinas recreativas en 1996 por Psikyo como secuela del shooter de 1993 Sengoku Ace. Más tarde se incluyó en Psikyo Shooting Collection Vol. 2: Sengoku Ace & Sengoku Blade para PlayStation 2.\n\nEl juego se ambienta en una versión de fantasía histórica del período Sengoku de la historia de Japón, con demonios, magia y robótica de vapor. Le siguió Sengoku Cannon: Sengoku Ace Episode III, lanzado para PlayStation Portable en 2005.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1996",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
